:: Widgets MP NPC Monet [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpInitNpcMonet">>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.monet>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, axis: 0, axisLabel: "缪斯", pigment: 0, artworks: 0, poseStyle: "none", deepStage: 0, sketchPages: 0, nextStepDay: 0, setback: 0, rep: 50, weekKey: -1, upkeepWeek: -1, relDay: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.axis is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axis to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.monet.axisLabel>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.axisLabel to "缪斯">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.pigment is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.pigment to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.artworks is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.artworks to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.monet.poseStyle>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.poseStyle to "none">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.deepStage is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.deepStage to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.sketchPages is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.sketchPages to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.nextStepDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.nextStepDay to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.setback is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.setback to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.rep is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.rep to 50>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.weekKey is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.weekKey to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.upkeepWeek is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.upkeepWeek to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.monet.relDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.monet.relDay to 0>><</if>>
<</widget>>

:: MP NPC Monet Deep Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if !$mpMonetEnded and $mpWorldMonetEnding>><<set $mpMonetEnded to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpWorldMonetEnding is "private">><<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>><<if (_npc.upkeepWeek or 0) isnot _wk>><<set _npc.upkeepWeek to _wk>><<money -25>><</if>><</if>>
<<mpInitNpcCross>>
康努达图斯街顶层的阁楼画室里，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>立在天窗斜光下审视画布，墙上手绘进度表记着缪斯共鸣 <<print _npc.axis>>、矿物颜料 <<print _npc.pigment>> 份、馆藏画作 <<print _npc.artworks>> 幅与壁画速写 <<print _npc.sketchPages>> 页。<<if $mpNpcCrossLast and $mpNpcCrossLast.monet>>画架边角还别着一张速写，写着「<<print $mpNpcCrossLast.monet>>」。<<else>>松节油香气在斜光里浮动。<</if>><<if $mpWorldMonetEnding is "private">>内室画阁长年落锁，每周要单支一笔恒温灯油费。<<elseif $mpWorldMonetEnding is "public">>侧厅壁画公开后看客络绎不绝，画室私密色粉结余比从前薄了一成。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[查看作息表 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Schedule]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[承接画室委托 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Loop]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[查看馆藏画作展 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Subsys]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_npc.setback or 0)>>
<<link [[查看画室休整木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpMonetEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldMonetEnding is "private">><<link [[重温私人画阁终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Ending B]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[重温公共壁画终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Ending A]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>
<<link [[去她现在所在 (0:05)|MP NPC Monet Schedule]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP NPC Monet Quest Waiting [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
阁楼天窗拉上了半幅亚麻帘。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>用松节油布擦净刮刀，说侧厅壁画只在白昼十点至二十点的天光下看得出底色，且每动一层底灰都要隔天等胶水干透。<<if (_npc.sketchPages or 0) lt 6 and (_npc.deepStage or 0) lt 5>>画夹里的壁画速写眼下只攒了 <<print (_npc.sketchPages or 0)>> 页，还得靠每周画室结算一页页补齐。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回缪斯深枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[明天再来问一次 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest Closed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
画室木门上挂着「闭门调色」的铜牌，侧厅脚手架也盖上了防尘油布。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>隔着门缝低声说，上次在壁画前失手耗损了矿物颜料与画廊声望，这两天她要先稳住受潮的底灰，过两天再来动刀。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回缪斯深枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[过两天再来看看 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Tier Action [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
天窗下的画架支着未干的底布，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>用松节油布擦净指尖的群青。眼下缪斯共鸣停在 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if _npc.axis gte 60 and (_npc.love or 0) gte 20>>里间那几幅从不示人的私藏速写已经向你敞开，每一张背面都有你的侧影<<elseif _npc.axis gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>>她调色时会自然地让你帮着比对冷暖灰阶<<else>>她待你仍带着画师审视模特的距离感，但已不再藏起底稿<</if>>。
天窗外的浮云缓缓游过屋脊，画架旁的松节油罐散着清冽的微香。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[闲聊天光冷暖 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpMonetTierTalk>><<set $daily.mpMonetTierTalk to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深谈画布后旧事 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<if _npc.axis gte 15 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 5>><<if !$daily.mpMonetTierDeep>><<set $daily.mpMonetTierDeep to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 6)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[陪她刮洗旧调色板 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Daily 15]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Loop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopDay_monet isnot Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopDay_monet to Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_monet to "none">><</if>>
画室长桌上摆着待办的采风与显影活计，当前矿物颜料存有 <<print _npc.pigment>> 份，雾潮水尺 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>说今日只能定一种光线：要么趁正午天窗强光做速写，要么封死窗帘进暗室显影，要么去街口追雾里的行人；本轮光线<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "light">>已定天窗强光，暗室药液已封存<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "darkroom">>已封窗进暗室，天窗正午光已过<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "street">>已定街口雾景，阁楼两处光线都已让出<<else>>选定一处便会关掉另外两处<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "none" or $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "light">>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[趁正午光速写 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Loop Light]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "none" or $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "darkroom">>
<<mpveilicon>><<link [[封窗进暗室显影 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Loop Darkroom]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "none" and !$daily.mpLoopThirdMonet>>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去街口画雾中行人 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 15>><<set $daily.mpLoopThirdMonet to 1>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_monet to "street">><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[街口已收工 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Loop Light [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "darkroom">>
天窗已被厚黑绒布严严实实封死，屋里满是定影药水的酸气。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>摇了摇头说，因为今日先开了暗室显影盘，正午最亮的那束天窗斜光已经过去了，没法再开窗写生。
<<else>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_monet to "light">><<set _npc.poseStyle to "light">>
<<else>>
<<set _already to 1>>
<</if>>
天窗正午的强光笔直落下来，同日暗室显影的药盘随之收起封存。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>让你站在光影交界处保持同一个姿势，笔锋飞快地捕捉轮廓：强光速写最能激发缪斯共鸣，但长时间绷紧脊背极其耗神。<<if _already>>今日这一轮强光已经画过，她只把画布翻面给你看刚才留下的明暗交界，余下的时辰留着收笔。<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回委托 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "darkroom">>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看错失代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<elseif _already>>
<<link [[今日已走过 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[站稳撑满整场画 (0:16)|MP NPC Monet Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<if !$daily.mpMonetLightAct>><<set $daily.mpMonetLightAct to 1>><<tiredness 3>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 6)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[按时替她调反光板 (0:14)|MP NPC Monet Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpMonetLightAct>><<set $daily.mpMonetLightAct to 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 4)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Loop Darkroom [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "light">>
阁楼天窗大敞着，正午的阳光晒暖了整间屋子。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>指了指角落的红灯说，因为今日先开了天窗速写，屋里温度太高，显影药液容易跑光变质，暗室只能留到明日再开。
<<else>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_monet to "darkroom">><<set _npc.poseStyle to "darkroom">>
<<else>>
<<set _already to 1>>
<</if>>
厚黑绒布将天窗遮得一丝不漏，同日天窗强光速写随之错过。红灯亮起幽暗的光，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>用竹夹把底片浸入显影液：暗室洗片能稳定提纯剩下的银盐与矿物色粉，但闷在药水气味里容易让人头晕胸闷。<<if _already>>这一轮暗室已经洗过，她把用过的药盘并排扣好，只让你看清相纸上留下的灰阶。<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回委托 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "light">>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看错失代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<elseif _already>>
<<link [[今日已走过 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[掐秒数夹出底片 (0:14)|MP NPC Monet Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpMonetDarkAct>><<set $daily.mpMonetDarkAct to 1>><<stress 2>><<set _npc.pigment += 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 3)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[在红灯下漂洗相纸 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily.mpMonetDarkAct>><<set $daily.mpMonetDarkAct to 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 4)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Loop Lockout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
日影在木地板上爬过一道窄斜线，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>蹲下身，用炭笔沿着窗棂的投影在墙根描下今日最后的角度。她说阁楼只认这一束光：正午硬光能落到几时、暗室红灯该亮到几分，全看这条线走到哪里；偏过一寸，颜色就换一种脾气。她把明日的刻痕又描深半分，才示意你跟着渐渐西斜的光下楼。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回委托改日 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[循光下楼 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Loop Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_monet is "street">><<set _npc.poseStyle to "street">><</if>>
今日选定的是<<if _npc.poseStyle is "light">>天窗强光速写<<elseif _npc.poseStyle is "darkroom">>暗室红灯显影<<else>>雾中街景临摹<</if>>，当前缪斯共鸣 <<print _npc.axis>>，手头矿物颜料 <<print _npc.pigment>> 份，壁画速写 <<print _npc.sketchPages>> 页。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>用骨质刮刀将调色盘上剩余的矿物色粉细细刮进带盖白瓷罐，擦净指尖松节油迹，看你要收拢入匣还是扩充馆藏。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回缪斯深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[收拢色粉入匣 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpLoopSettleMonet>><<set $daily.mpLoopSettleMonet to 1>><<if (_npc.weekKey or -1) isnot _wk>><<set _npc.weekKey to _wk>><<set _npc.sketchPages to Math.min(6, (_npc.sketchPages or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 200 or ($willpower or 0) gte 320 or _npc.axis gte 20>><<set _npc.pigment += ($mpWorldMonetEnding is "public" ? 1 : 2)>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 4)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set _npc.pigment += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[捧颜料罐去馆藏墙 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Subsys]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Subsys [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
里间展墙上的铜钉挂着你们攒下的馆藏画作：当前已有 <<print _npc.artworks>> 幅，手头存有矿物颜料 <<print _npc.pigment>> 份。<<if _npc.artworks gte 3>>三面展墙已经挂满，每一幅都记录着一段海雾与光影<<else>>空着的墙面还在等下一幅成品，每攒够两份矿物颜料就能绷布完成一幅新馆藏<</if>>。
天窗外的浮云缓缓游过屋脊，画架旁的松节油罐散着清冽的微香。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回缪斯深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[投入颜料作画 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Subsys Upgrade]]>><<pass 15>><<if _npc.artworks lt 3 and _npc.pigment gte 2>><<set _npc.pigment -= 2>><<set _npc.artworks += 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 5)>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去接画室委托攒料 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Loop]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Subsys Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
新画挂上展墙铜钉，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>退后三步看了许久才满意地点头。如今馆藏画作已有 <<print _npc.artworks>> 幅，剩余矿物颜料 <<print _npc.pigment>> 份。她把窗帘拢开半扇，让午后的暖光斜照在长椅上，留你坐下喝杯温茶歇口气。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回缪斯深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回馆藏页查看 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Subsys]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[坐在画作前静休整 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if _npc.artworks gte 1>><<stress -4>><<tiredness -2>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Scene Morning [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
瓷碟里群青还未开。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把刮刀递过来，说调匀了才能上第一层。
