:: MP NPC Monet Scene Finale [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $mpMonetEnded>><<if $mpWorldMonetEnding is "private">><<goto "MP NPC Monet Ending B">><<else>><<goto "MP NPC Monet Ending A">><</if>><</if>>
脚手架前，整墙底稿只够公开或封进私阁。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把刮刀交给你。选定就不能回头。
松节油气味在斜光里浮动，画架木纹被摸得发亮，窗外街车碾过石板。松节油气味在斜光里浮动，画架木纹被摸得发亮，窗外街车碾过石板。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回去 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[公开侧厅壁画 (0:20)|MP NPC Monet Ending A]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpMonScFinale to 1>><<set $mpMonetIrreversibleChoice to "public">><<set $mpMonetEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldMonetEnding to "public">><</link>><br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[封进私人画阁 (0:20)|MP NPC Monet Ending B]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpMonScFinale to 1>><<set $mpMonetIrreversibleChoice to "private">><<set $mpMonetEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldMonetEnding to "private">><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Ending A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if $mpMonetEnded and $mpWorldMonetEnding is "private">><<goto "MP NPC Monet Ending B">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpMonetEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpMonetEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldMonetEnding to "public">><<set $mpMonetIrreversibleChoice to "public">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("monet_ending_public_v50")>><<money 1600>><<set _npc.pigment to (_npc.pigment or 0) + 2>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
红绸落下的刹那，整面海雾与晨光交织的巨幅壁画震住了满厅看客，当年的抄袭流言不攻自破。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>没有理会涌上来的沙龙评委，只穿过人群走到你身边，低声说门边那束最暖的光完全是照着你站过的位置调出来的。自壁画公开后，侧厅颜料常年耗在修补上，画室结算的色粉比从前少了一截。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回缪斯深枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[返回莫奈身边小坐 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Ending B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if $mpMonetEnded and $mpWorldMonetEnding is "public">><<goto "MP NPC Monet Ending A">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpMonetEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpMonetEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldMonetEnding to "private">><<set $mpMonetIrreversibleChoice to "private">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("monet_ending_private_v50")>><<money 1600>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
阁楼里间的木门轻轻合拢，将街面的喧嚣彻底关在门外。那幅历经波折的壁画静静立在只属于你们两人的灯光下，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>把配好的第二把黄铜钥匙塞进你掌心，指了指画角并排写着的两个名字。内室恒温油灯每周都要单支一笔维护费，她却说这笔账算得值。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回缪斯深枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[返回莫奈身边小坐 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Schedule [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>> <<set $location to "town">> <<effects>> <<mpAmbient>> <<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 10 and Time.hour lt 14>>午前天光斜进阁楼。<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>在调群青，刮刀搁在瓷碟边，群青还没开匀。
<<elseif Time.hour gte 14 and Time.hour lt 20>>午后侧厅脚手架上，她盯着未竟壁画的底灰，袖口沾着石灰，木梯吱呀响。
<<else>>夜里画室只留一盏恒温灯，她坐在窗台擦笔，街上马车声很远，灯芯结着一点焦。
<</if>>松节油气味在斜光里浮动，画架木纹被摸得发亮，窗外街车碾过石板，颜料匣的铜扣被指腹磨白。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_npc.setback or 0)>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[看休整木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpMonetEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldMonetEnding is "private">><<link [[回终局乙 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Ending B]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[回终局甲 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Ending A]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>松节油在斜光里浮动，画架木纹发亮，窗外街车碾过石板缓慢远去。
<<if Time.hour gte 10 and Time.hour lt 14 and !$daily.mpMonScMorning>><<mppainticon>><<link [[帮她调群青 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Scene Morning]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 14 and Time.hour lt 20 and !$daily.mpMonScHall>><<investigateicon>><<link [[上脚手架看灰 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Scene Noon]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif (Time.hour gte 20 or Time.hour lt 10) and !$daily.mpMonScNight>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[陪她擦笔杆 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Scene Night]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif !$daily.mpMonScTea>><<shopicon>><<link [[窗台喝淡茶 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Scene Rest]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[去街口走走 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Street 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.deepStage or 0) gte 5 and (_npc.sketchPages or 0) gte 6 and !$mpMonetEnded and !$daily.mpMonScFinale and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpscaleicon>><<link [[站上脚手架前 (0:16)|MP NPC Monet Scene Finale]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.sketchPages or 0) gte 6 and !$daily.mpMonScSk6 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[摊齐六页收集 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Scene Page6]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 40 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 40) and !$daily.mpMonScRel40 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[跟对方进内室 (0:20)|MP NPC Monet Scene Rel40]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.rep or 50) lt 30 and !$daily.mpMonScRepLow and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[应付馆方盘问 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Scene RepLow]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.rep or 50) gte 70 and !$daily.mpMonScRepHigh and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收下画商谢礼 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Scene RepHigh]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.sketchPages or 0) gte 4 and !$daily.mpMonScSk4 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[继续辨认收集 (0:15)|MP NPC Monet Scene Page4]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 25) and !$daily.mpMonScRel25 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[并肩靠窗台 (0:14)|MP NPC Monet Scene Rel25]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.sketchPages or 0) gte 2 and !$daily.mpMonScSk2 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[对读两页收集 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Scene Page2]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 10 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10) and !$daily.mpMonScRel10 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[接过她递的茶 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Scene Rel10]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>><<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[核对关系阶位 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Tier Action]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Note [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
你推开阁楼虚掩的木门时画室空无一人，调色盘下压着一张沾着群青指印的画纸便条：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 60>>『我去侧厅看一眼壁画底灰，窗台左起第二罐是给你留的热可可，里间未揭布的画只准你一个人掀开，下午两点或入夜七点回来。』<<elseif (_npc.axis or 0) gte 25>>『去高街买亚麻籽油，桌上有刚烤干的松饼，申时前后回阁楼。』<<else>>『外出写生，勿动未干画布，傍晚归。』<</if>>
天窗外的浮云缓缓游过屋脊，画架旁的松节油罐散着清冽的微香。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回作息 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[盖布留炭笔 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if !$daily.mpMonetNoteSign>><<set $daily.mpMonetNoteSign to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[前往同城交集 (0:06)|MP NPC Cross Monet Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Street 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
康努达图斯街拱廊下的旧画材摊前，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>正迎着侧光挑拣两管锡皮颜料。当前缪斯共鸣为 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 40>>她一看见你便把挑好的群青与钛白塞进你的衣袋，拉着你的袖口去拱廊台阶下看雨后反光<<else>>她对比过两块色板，抬头请你也帮着看一眼哪块灰调更正<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回上一页 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 40>><<link [[帮她付钱挑铅白 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetMonet>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetMonet to 1>><<money -40>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">帮她付钱挑铅白 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[背画箱陪她回阁楼 (0:12)|MP NPC Monet Loop]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetMonet>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetMonet to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 3>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Daily 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcMonet>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
入夜后的阁楼只点着一盏暖黄煤油灯，<<if _npc.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>年轻画师<</if>>用刮刀一点点铲起胡桃木调色板上干结的油彩壳。当前缪斯共鸣为 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 35>>她把刮下的一小片双色油彩卷封进玻璃坠子里递给你，说这是你们一起调过的第一抹雾青<<else>>她教你怎样顺着木纹滴核桃油保养板面，免得木板开裂吃色<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回关系阶位 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Tier Action]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[顺着木纹上油 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyMonet15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet15 to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.pigment += 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mppainticon>><<link [[帮你把坠子别上 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyMonet15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyMonet15 to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
